# Callback from the notation browser: takes the chosen path as target, derives the title,
# stops auto-overwrite, writes to the log and redraws.

Calculate cTargetPath as $cinst.$shortPath(pTargetPath) ## the browser returns $fullname
Set reference iTargetRef to iTools.$pathToRefQuiet(cTargetPath)
Calculate cLogTitle as $cinst.$titleFromScript(cScript,cTargetPath,cSourcePath)
Calculate cOverwritePathAndTitle as kFalse
Do $cinst.$logSetValues()
Do $cinst.$redraw()